---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
const today = new Date().toLocaleDateString();
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Sample hosted AI disclosure page — TransparentAI"
  description="A preview of the public AI transparency page TransparentAI hosts for customers."
>
  <section class="border-b border-border bg-surface">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col gap-3 px-6 py-8 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">
          Hosted disclosure page · Preview
        </div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          Lives at <span class="font-mono text-primary">acme-notes.disclosur.co</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <a href="/packet">
          <button class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-accent/10">Back to packet</button>
        </a>
        <button class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-primary px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90">Publish</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14">
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-10">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary">
        <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Acme Notes — AI Transparency</div>
      </div>
      <h1 class="mt-6 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary md:text-4xl">
        How we use AI at Acme Notes
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        We use third-party AI models to power summarization, chat, and tagging
        features in our product. This page describes which features use AI, which
        providers we rely on, and how we label AI-generated content for our users.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-primary">AI features in our product</h2>
          <div class="mt-2">
            <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-1.5 text-muted-foreground marker:text-accent">
              <li><strong class="text-primary">Meeting summarizer</strong> — AI-generated summary text from your meeting transcripts.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-primary">In-app chat assistant</strong> — A conversational AI that helps you search and act on your notes.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-primary">Auto-tagging</strong> — AI-assisted labeling of notes for organization.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Model providers</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
            We currently use models from OpenAI and Anthropic. We do not allow these
            providers to train on your data. Inputs and outputs may be retained by the
            provider for up to 30 days for abuse monitoring.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-primary">How AI-generated content is labeled</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
            AI-generated text in Acme Notes is shown with a visible
            "AI-generated" indicator. The chat assistant identifies itself as AI in
            every conversation. We are rolling out persistent labeling for AI-suggested
            tags in our next release.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Changes and updates</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
            We publish a changelog of meaningful changes to our AI features. This page
            was last updated on {today}.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
            Questions about how we use AI? Email{" "}
            <a class="text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline" href="mailto:ai@acmenotes.example">ai@acmenotes.example</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 border-t border-border pt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
        Hosted by TransparentAI · This page is generated documentation, not legal advice.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
